 "traditions": [],
 "notes": "Tier shelf. Kept both old kinds (k144 Guitar case, k148 Music stand) and added Instrument stand, Pedalboard, Drum pedal and hardware. Trimmed guitar-case ranges (dropped Gator 4G/Pro-Go duplicate ranges and MONO Vertigo range, now a model); old maker labels 'Hamilton (music stands)' and 'Peak (music stands)' shortened to Hamilton and Peak. Drum pedals carry three archetypes (DW 5000, Tama Iron Cobra, Pearl Eliminator); DW 5000 origin year and Camco lineage left out (forum sources disagreed); Yamaha drum hardware left out (no page retrieved). No register entries for Hamilton, Peak, Levy's, Ibanez, Fender (stand/case makers from old data only or covered elsewhere). Hiscox, SKB have no named guitar-case lines on retrieved pages. Wikidata was rate-limited."
}